// GetProviderProviderIDRequireMessageSigning reads ./Device/Vendor/MSFT/DMClient/Provider/{providerID}/RequireMessageSigning.
// Primarily used for SSL bridging mode where firewalls and proxies are deployed and where device
// client identity is required. When enabled, every SyncML message from the device will carry an
